WEBVTT

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:07.400
Yes! I'll deign to make you both mine!

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.400
T-To claim us on our very first meeting...

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.960
This human is terrifying!

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.530
You stupid or somethin'?!

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.110
You can't think we'd agree to that!

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:17.480
You dare speak back to me?

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:18.590
How intriguing!

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:21.340
Sora, Runa, my desire for you only grows!

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.520
Explain yourself. What's this all about?

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.830
And who, exactly, are you?

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:28.220
My name is Edgar Fromware.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.300
I'm the son of the lord of Horizon.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:32.620
The lord...

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:34.030
Indeed.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:38.320
Offering yourselves to me will give you 
access to unparalleled luxury.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.060
Our answer is no!

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:42.640
We've got a master and his name is Rein!

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.980
You continue to resist me, then?

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:54.220
Hand them over to me now.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.320
You don't want to see them hurt, do you?

00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:57.980
I won't do it.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:00.910
I'd never give Sora and Runa 
to a man like you.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:02.370
Rein!

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:04.620
I see.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:05.960
Do it.

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:18.800
<b>Beast Tamer</b>

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:39.800
Darkness in Horizon

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:39.800
Darkness in Horizon

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.680
Why can't you beat one single opponent?!

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:47.360
You incompetent fools!

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:50.520
H-He's no ordinary man.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:52.890
I'd advise you to give it up already.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:55.860
I won't let you have 
Sora and Runa, no matter what.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:02:59.720
Don't be absurd.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:03.380
When I want something, I <i>get it.</i>

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:13.280
What now, trash?

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:17.500
Give me what I want, 
or it's them who'll pay the price!

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.670
Are you kidding me?

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:20.140
They're your own subjects!

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:21.720
Oh, I'm dead serious.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:25.210
Peasants are nothing but tools.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:27.930
It's up to a tool's owner 
to decide how it's used.

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:31.480
Hand the girls over and I'll spare them.

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:35.920
<i>They're all spread out.</i>

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:39.990
<i>If I go to save one, 
the others will be injured!</i>

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:41.710
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:43.700
Should we step in here?

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:47.690
They do not know of our magical nature.

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:48.790
We might take advantage of that.

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:52.500
<i>If they use magic, 
everyone will learn they're fairies.</i>

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:56.210
<i>We won't be able to stay in the city then.</i>

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:58.750
<i>After they liked it so much...</i>

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:01.080
<i>Isn't there some other way?</i>

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:05.160
<i>To protect the townspeople, Sora, and Runa? 
Everyone together?</i>

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:09.960
<i>Those magic circles... Fireball?</i>

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:14.020
<i>No, there was something extra there...</i>

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.480
<i>I'll just have to try it!</i>

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:17.390
Excuse me!

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:21.070
I'll have your answer now, 
or else I'll begin the executions!

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:23.280
My answer...

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:27.490
Is that I'll never let you have your way!

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.210
Fireball!

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:35.460
Multi-shot!

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:42.750
<i>A consecutive incantation!</i>

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:48.390
<i>A special fairy skill that lets you cast 
one spell multiple times at once!</i>

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:52.810
Leave. And never show your face here again.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.340
How dare you?!

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:58.900
You'll regret this act of defiance!

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.190
Lord Edgar!

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.830
Wait!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.490
I guess that worked out.

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.320
Ah, Rein...

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.720
You have our most heartfelt thanks!

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:10.950
Thanks a bunch!

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:15.910
Nice work, Mr. Beast Tamer!

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:18.780
Thanks for stopping that big, lousy jerk!

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:21.050
I was so worried.

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.570
I can't thank you enough.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:24.800
You were cooler than the Hero!

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:27.640
Oh, well, I...

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:30.470
I'm just glad you're all safe.

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:33.800
It was quite touch and go 
for the little ladies as well.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:36.320
I'm just glad to see you safe.

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:38.400
Oh, thank you...

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.110
Aw, I'm blushin'!

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:44.320
But now that you're safe, you should leave.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.820
Leave Horizon and go somewhere far away.

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:02.460
Bam! Whozzawhozzawhozza! 
Za-bomb! Ker-blam!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:06.250
And with that, Rein's newest super skill, 
consecutive incantation,

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:08.620
blasted away all the bad guys!

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.930
Super skill, huh?

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:16.880
I believe it to be the power 
you acquired by contracting with us.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:20.720
Advanced fairy magic control!

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:22.760
You think?

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.360
In addition to the continuous incantation,

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:29.480
I think I had a better handle on my power 
and my aim than the last time I practiced.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:34.410
Perhaps our contract has allowed you to 
better control the prodigious magical power

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:36.680
afforded you by Tania!

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:39.850
A significant expansion 
of your magical potential!

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:45.840
We've proved we're excellent familiars, 
just like Kanade and Tania!

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.450
You both did great!

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:50.920
I'm simply glad you're all safe.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:55.880
Honestly, I can't believe 
<i>we</i> slept through it all!

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:00.690
That jerk's gonna pay 
for trying to steal Sora and Runa!

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:05.770
According to the townspeople, 
he's even more dangerous than I imagined.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:09.680
He kidnaps women who catch his eye, 
keeps them in his mansion,

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:11.580
and abuses them.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.970
What an absolute bastard.

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:20.330
Even as the son of the local lord, 
how can he get away with such things?

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:24.620
Edgar is the lord's only son,

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:28.300
and the lord uses his power 
to silence his victims.

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:30.700
That's awful!

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.010
Why don't the knights arrest that lord?

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.710
The knights have investigated the lord,

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:39.080
but they couldn't find evidence, 
so it went nowhere!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:42.850
He must be very skilled 
at concealing evidence.

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:44.440
I see now.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:48.240
Perhaps it's time to burn 
his mansion to the ground.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:49.800
Wait, wait, wait!

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:52.070
You can't just rush in there, fire blazing!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.470
But...

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:56.910
He might come after Sora and Runa again!

00:07:58.470 --> 00:07:59.800
Tania...

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:00.870
And the townspeople.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.830
And you, too!

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:08.990
That's all the more reason 
to act with caution.

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:09.800
Rein?

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:13.470
<i>Having learned 
about the darkness in this city...</i>

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:17.760
<i>I...</i>

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:21.750
<i>I want to save them all.</i>

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:23.740
<i>But...</i>

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:28.260
<i>I'm not a Hero or champion of any kind.</i>

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.690
<i>I'm just a beast tamer.</i>

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:33.300
You should leave.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:36.300
<i>Will we really...</i>

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:38.640
"Will we really have to leave the city?"

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.540
That's what you're thinking, right?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:43.870
But you won't be able 
to help the city like that.

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:46.330
Right, Rein?

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.540
Kanade... how?

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.040
We know how you think.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:52.050
We've been with you all this time.

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:54.940
You want to save everyone,

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.520
but because you're dealing 
with an influential person,

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:00.940
you think you have to choose 
between us and the townspeople.

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:02.940
You, too, Tania?

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:06.480
I find it unhealthy to take 
too many burdens on oneself.

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:09.120
But that is part of your nature, Rein.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:11.680
And that's why we like smilin' with ya!

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:13.610
Sora... Runa...

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.960
And it's not just you, Rein!

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:18.840
We wanna protect this city, too!

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:21.800
Yes, and humans are quite amusing!

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:24.720
I still have my difficulties 
being around humans,

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:27.470
but I do feel affection for this city!

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:31.770
Yep! Everyone's nice, 
and they've got tasty hot dogs!

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:33.670
Thank you, everyone.

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:39.600
Let's solve this problem and save the city!

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.460
Yeah!

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:45.020
All right, Edgar.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:49.070
Remember to tell me if you need my aid.

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:51.730
It's no matter, Father. I'll handle it all.

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.310
Gilet.

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:56.640
About today's events...

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:57.280
Right.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:10:01.870
As usual, if anyone files complaints, 
I'll have them dealt with.

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:04.250
And one other thing.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.330
Investigate the man known as Rein.

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:09.740
Bring him to me if possible, even.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.000
For your service today.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:15.500
If you bring me Rein, I'll add on a bonus.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:17.470
I'll return with good news.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:24.810
<i>He humiliated me today.</i>

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.190
<i>I will make him regret it!</i>

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:35.230
E-Excuse me...

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:38.400
Um... how can I—

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.360
You're late!

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:42.320
Didn't I tell you to come 
as soon as I called you?!

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:45.120
But I did come—

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.410
You trash!

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:49.630
Never talk back to me!

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:55.910
Go on, scream!

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:58.220
I love hearing you scream!

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:00.420
<i>Someone...</i>

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.100
<i>Someone help me!</i>

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:11.940
This is the Order of Knights?

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:15.850
I haven't done anything wrong, 
but I still feel kinda nervous...

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:18.150
Are you sure you're okay with just me?

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:21.210
Sora and Runa are 
a bit conspicuous right now.

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:23.240
They're better off 
staying at the inn with Tania.

00:11:23.960 --> 00:11:25.200
Come on.

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:26.940
Excuse me.

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:31.630
If I file a complaint, you'll investigate?

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:32.170
Yes.

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:37.180
The Order of Knights exists 
to uphold order in this city.

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:39.130
I'd like to report an assault

00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:43.080
perpetrated by the lord's son, Edgar, 
in the plaza the other day.

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:47.260
The king entrusted you 
to maintain order in the city, right?

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.880
So I'm sure you'll see to it.

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:50.430
W-Well...

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:52.640
No need for that.

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:55.320
I heard that was a minor scuffle.

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:58.480
No need for the Knights 
to investigate such a trivial matter.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.920
A trivial matter?!

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:03.420
That lord's son tried 
to force Sora and Runa to—

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:09.480
Slandering Lord Edgar 
with mountains made out of molehills

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:12.880
would get us executed for treason!

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:14.000
Is that so?

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:19.920
Their behavior made it clear.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.470
The knights are in cahoots with the lord.

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:26.030
That would make it easy 
to cover up his crimes,

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:29.100
and explain why investigations 
never turn up proof.

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:31.500
I had a feeling that was the case.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:32.760
That's awful.

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:34.700
Who's there?

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.600
A-A knight?

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:39.900
You followed us?

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.150
N-No!

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:43.390
Well, I did follow you,

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:45.860
but it's because I wanted to talk to you!

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:50.400
As a knight, I should have been 
more forthright with you.

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:51.600
Forgive me!

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.790
My dishonorable conduct 
fostered this misunderstanding!

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.580
Huh?

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:59.050
<i>A proud member of the Knights, bowing to us?</i>

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:00.750
I-I understand!

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.830
You're forgiven, okay?

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.090
I see.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:04.800
Thank you.

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:07.800
My name is Stella Enplace.

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:10.760
I'm vice captain of the Horizon 
branch of the Order of Knights.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.430
Vice captain?!

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.590
I-I'm Rein Shroud.

00:13:14.590 --> 00:13:15.680
I'm Kanade!

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:17.420
Rein. Kanade.

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.860
I see. So it <i>is</i> you.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.790
Before I explain, let me first thank you.

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:24.280
Thank us?

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:30.170
I've heard that the dangerous bandits 
known as the Ebon Fangs

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:32.490
were dispatched by a cat spirit girl 
and an adventurer.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:40.230
Then, as now, I've felt insufficient to my 
assigned task of protecting the people.

00:13:40.890 --> 00:13:44.920
I want to punish 
the lord's family's wrongdoing.

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:48.890
I want your help to accomplish that!

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:53.990
Most of the Knights have been corrupted 
through collusion with the lord.

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:56.300
They've forgotten their knightly duties.

00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:58.980
They not only cover up the crimes 
of the lord and his son,

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:02.190
but fully neglect the townspeople 
they're meant to protect.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:05.650
Our leader, Captain Gilet, is no exception.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:09.580
I want to restore the Knights 
to how they should be.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:12.580
And as I was considering 
how to do that, you appeared.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:16.990
The adventurer and the ultimate species 
who destroyed the Ebon Fangs,

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:19.170
filing a complaint against the lord's son.

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:22.140
It could be a turning point!

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:23.260
So I thought.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.900
Shamed though I am to say it,

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:29.690
despite my rank, there are only 
a few of my comrades I can trust.

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:32.350
Would you grant me your aid?

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.300
I'd like to, but...

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:36.040
<i>Can we trust her?</i>

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.920
<i>What if it's a trap of some kind?</i>

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:39.310
It'll be okay, Rein.

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:41.900
Stella's a good person!

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:43.900
I don't get any bad vibes from her at all!

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.490
If you say so, it must be true.

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:52.600
We'd be happy to help, then.

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:53.640
Really?

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:54.200
Yeah.

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:58.760
We want the same thing, 
and I think we can be of use to you.

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:00.840
I suppose I should ask,

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:03.820
but why are you going after the lord?

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:05.370
Why?

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:07.770
Well, we found out what was happening, 
and we had to do something.

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:08.300
What?

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.400
Th-That's your only reason?

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:11.580
Yeah, sure.

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:12.760
Is that weird?

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:17.030
Wh-What's so funny?!

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:18.970
I'm so sorry.

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:20.690
I don't mean any mockery,

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:23.690
but you said it so forthrightly...

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:26.400
Still, I find your attitude charming.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:29.360
Yes, truly charming.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:34.780
If only I could have done it earlier...

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.250
It's not too late.

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:43.720
Rein...

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.510
Yes, thank you.

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:47.690
Okay!

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:51.580
Let's take down that lord 
and the Order of Knights!

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:54.480
Oh, but we can't do anything without proof.

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:56.460
We'd be accused of treason!

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:57.310
What?!

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:59.530
It's a good idea, actually.

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:02.270
We can take them all down in one fell swoop.

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:06.140
Let's take this opportunity 
to clean house at the Knights.

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:08.610
Clean house? How?

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.460
We'll set a trap.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:40.970
Amazing.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.890
It went just as you predicted, Rein!

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:46.810
We've got this in the bag!

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:50.840
Do not speak with such confidence 
in such an ominous situation!

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:53.320
Okay. Let's carry out the plan.

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:55.690
<i>Rumors say</i>

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:59.280
<i>a warehouse on the city's outskirts contains 
proof of our collusion with the lord.</i>

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:00.940
<i>Ridiculous.</i>

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:03.250
This is a difficult situation.

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:07.210
<i>But if it's true, 
and the proof were to become public,</i>

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.880
<i>it would be the end 
of both Lord Edgar and us.</i>

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:13.210
<i>We must deal with it swiftly and carefully,</i>

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:18.260
<i>without those naive fools who still believe 
in the pipe dream of chivalry finding out.</i>

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:21.020
All ready!

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:22.920
We'll go in now.

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:25.550
Destroy our target as soon as you see it.

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:26.230
Yes, sir!

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:31.880
Hey. We need light.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:32.400
Right!

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:35.660
It's an ambush!

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:37.320
Get out of the warehouse at once!

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:40.190
We're trapped!

00:17:40.190 --> 00:17:42.370
Get it open! It's cold!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.660
We shall see to it...

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.000
...that none of the bad knights escape!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.550
Amazing. The accuracy is perfect!

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:57.640
It was originally a trick 
for snaring animals.

00:17:58.060 --> 00:18:00.470
This is my new weapon.

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:01.770
Yeah.

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:04.460
The dagger'll take a bit longer yet,

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:06.940
but the gauntlet's come together.

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:12.420
For you, Rein, who reminded me 
of my blacksmith's pride.

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:15.880
I hope it's of use to you.

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:18.300
<i>It's the best equipment ever.</i>

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:19.610
<i>I truly thank you.</i>

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:22.330
<i>This will be...</i>

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:23.280
<i>the end!</i>

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:27.960
Don't underestimate me!

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:30.820
There you are...

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:33.710
Stella Enplace!

00:18:34.030 --> 00:18:36.120
Gilet Stregar...

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:37.170
Give yourself up!

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:39.480
Right about now,

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:42.640
my comrades and subordinates will be 
taking over the Order's branch office.

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:45.100
And the proof of your corruption!

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:47.020
How dare you?

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.060
Are you the one who spread 
that rumor, as well?

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:52.770
Rein. Things have gone 
our way this far, but...

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:55.640
I see. So you're Rein!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:58.590
Luck is on my side!

00:18:58.590 --> 00:19:00.810
Once I present you to Lord Edgar,

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:03.740
I'll be able to make up for my disgrace!

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:06.790
Would you grant me the honor 
of ending this myself?

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:07.930
Sure.

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:09.370
I am grateful.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.330
You think you can beat me?

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:17.080
You'll be executed for treason!

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:20.470
You're the traitor here—
to the soul of the knight!

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:26.640
Atone for your crime 
and regain your knight's justice,

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:27.640
Gilet Stregar!

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:28.850
Justice, you say?

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:32.600
The prattle of a little girl!

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:35.220
Stella!

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:36.400
Don't worry about me!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.720
There's no justice in this Order.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:42.820
No justice in this world!

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:44.200
And yet...

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:46.580
And yet I...

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.860
I will not be like you!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:12.360
Those who abandon justice for greed

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:13.810
are no longer knights!

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:22.220
You must be kidding me!

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:24.780
Gilet and the others were arrested,

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:28.620
and that stubborn stick-in-the-mud 
woman took over the Knights?!

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:30.520
Damn it!

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:33.580
They're all useless! 
They do nothing but sabotage me!

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:36.350
I'm sorry...

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:39.050
But no matter. Their numbers are few!

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:43.790
I have over a hundred 
personal guards to protect me.

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:46.010
You think they can, do you?

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:48.100
Who the hell are you?!

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:50.890
A sympathetic party.

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:55.810
And a hater of Rein Shroud, just like you.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:57.240
Rein...

00:20:57.240 --> 00:21:00.020
Has he been assisting in all this?

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:01.690
Indeed.

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:05.660
And he's a beast tamer 
who's tamed ultimate species.

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:08.950
You simply don't stand a chance against him.

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:10.980
Ultimate species?

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:18.780
He'll destroy your lifestyle 
and steal everything you value.

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:23.050
Your title, your honor, your money, 
your women. Everything.

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:24.740
Absolutely everything.

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:29.430
That's the kind of vile, little man he is.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:30.830
Don't be ridiculous!

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:32.880
This city belongs to me!

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:34.910
I won't let him have any part of it!

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:36.190
Wh-What's this?

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.520
I told you I was sympathetic.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:41.900
That's a magic item 
that brings death to its target.

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:44.840
You can use it to finish off Rein.

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:51.830
Such negative emotions.

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:55.410
That will draw out 
the ring's power even further.

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:58.500
Now, bring death to Rein!

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:39.980
Black Waves

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:39.030
Next Time: "Black Waves."
